# Original summary of the published cognitive walkthrough prompts.
# All four prompts apply even after a predicted difficulty. Not an observed user test.
direction: down
action: "One action\nspecified user and task"
q1: "Would the user pursue\nthe needed subgoal?"
q2: "Would the user notice\nthe available action?"
q3: "Would the user connect\naction and desired effect?"
q4: "Would feedback reveal\nprogress toward the task?"
record: "Record reasoning and cues\npredictions, not observations"
next: "Inspect next action\nor revise and inspect again"
action -> q1
q1 -> q2: also ask
q2 -> q3: also ask
q3 -> q4: also ask
q4 -> record
record -> next
